    <dc:language>en</dc:language>
    <dc:date>2017-05-15T00:00:00+00:00</dc:date>
    <dc:description>An Interactive fiction conceived as a creative reflection on the overlappings, echoes and analogies between the corporality of the book and the human body. It tells a story of transformation, sickness, death, and, maybe, rebirth.</dc:description>
    <dc:publisher>Self-Published</dc:publisher>
